[LINK: (1261) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1261]  –  [LINK: (Walter de Stapledon) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walter_de_Stapledon] , English bishop and politician,  [LINK: (Lord High Treasurer) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lord_High_Treasurer]  (died 1326) [LINK: ([42]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_1#cite_note-42]

