[LINK: (1447) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1447]  –  [LINK: (Eberhard II, Duke of Württemberg) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eberhard_II,_Duke_of_W%C3%BCrttemberg]  (died 1504)

